or S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImageEdit", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 28}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [197], "label": "text", "type": "*", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "show_help", "label": "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["Extract the fabric print pattern with these rules:\n1. REMOVE: folds, wrinkles, seams, buttons, shadows, creases, distortions, and any 3D curvature\n2. PRESERVE: original pattern colors, motif shapes, and repeating unit structure\n3. FLATTEN: spread the print smoothly across the entire canvas as a flat 2D seamless tile\n4. ALIGN: straighten all lines to be perfectly horizontal or vertical; make parallel motifs uniformly spaced\n5. FILL: seamlessly fill all gaps so the pattern is complete with no missing or broken elements\nOutput a clean, background-free print swatch on a pure white canvas."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "CR Text", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 140], "pos": [0, 2034], "id": 102, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CR Text", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#555060", "widgets_values": ["节点#3 KSampler\n作用：核心采样器：按步数/采样器/调度器将噪声迭代为目标 latent。\n参数：\n- seed：当前值=525543964753641；作用：随机种子，控制可复现性；范围：整数，常见 0 ~ 2^63-1；默认：0。\n- control_after_generate：当前值=randomize；作用：每次生成后对种子的处理策略；范围：固定/随机/递增等枚举值；默认：fixed。\n- steps：当前值=10；作用：采样步数，步数越高通常细节越充分；范围：整数，常见 1 ~ 150；默认：20。\n- cfg：当前值=1；作用：提示词引导强度；范围：浮点，常见 0.0 ~ 30.0；默认：7.0。\n- sampler_name：当前值=euler；作用：采样算法类型；范围：下拉枚举（如 euler / dpm / sa_solver）；默认：euler。\n- scheduler：当前值=simple；作用：噪声调度策略；范围：下拉枚举（normal / karras / beta 等）；默认：normal。\n- denoise：当前值=1；作用：去噪强度；1 表示完整重绘；范围：浮点 0.0 ~ 1.0；默认：1.0。\n- model：当前值=来自 节点#75 CFGNorm 的 `patched_model` 输出；作用：接收上游模型对象（具体是扩散模型、姿态模型或检测模型由该节点类型决定）；范围：模型对象（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- positive：当前值=来自 节点#76 TextEncodeQwenImageEdit 的 `CONDITIONING`…；作用：接收正向条件向量，告诉模型“应该生成什么”；范围：CONDITIONING 类型数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- negative：当前值=来自 节点#77 TextEncodeQwenImageEdit 的 `CONDITIONING`…；作用：接收负向条件向量，告诉模型“尽量避免什么”；范围：CONDITIONING 类型数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- latent_image：当前值=来自 节点#88 VAEEncode 的 `LATENT` 输出；作用：接收起始 latent 画布或中间 latent 结果，作为采样输入底稿；范围：latent 数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n邀请码：jq8lvwrk，领1000RH币"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#928aa6", "size": [240, 928], "pos": [1900, 310], "id": 106, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#555060", "widgets_values": ["节点#8 VAEDecode\n作用：将采样 latent 解码为可视图像。\n参数：\n- samples：当前值=来自 节点#3 KSampler 的 `LATENT` 输出；作用：接收待处理 latent 样本（如待解码或待上采样的数据）；范围：latent 数据（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n- vae：当前值=来自 节点#39 VAELoader 的 `VAE` 输出；作用：接收 VAE 对象，用于像素图像与 latent 之间转换；范围：VAE 对象（连线输入）；默认：由上游节点输出决定。\n邀请码：jq8lvwrk，领1000RH币"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#928aa6", "size": [240, 280], "pos": [2280, 188], "id": 107, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#555060", "widgets_values": ["节点#37 UNETLoader\n作用：加载扩散主干模型（UNet），决定核心生成能力。\n参数：\n- 无可调参数：当前值=N/A；作用：该节点通常无需手动调参；范围：N/A；默认：N/A。\n邀请码：jq8lvwrk，领1000RH币"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#928aa6", "size": [240, 154], "pos": [0, 908], "id": 108, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#555060", "widgets_values": ["节点#38 CLIPLoader\n作用：加载 CLIP 语义编码器，供文本/图像条件编码使用。\n参数：\n- 无可调参数：当前值=N/A；作用：该节点通常无需手动调参；范围：N/A；默认：N/A。\n邀请码：jq8lvwrk，领1000RH币"], "inputs": [], "flags